         "type": "text",
         "text": "The Museum of Meenakari Heritage (the \"Museum\", \"we\", \"us\") is located at Shekhawat Haveli, E141, Sardar Patel Marg, Durgadas Colony, C-Scheme, Ashok Nagar, Jaipur 302001, Rajasthan, India. The Museum belongs to The House of Sunita Shekhawat and is operated by Midas Signature Jewellery Private Limited, whose registered office is at E-141, Sardar Patel Marg, C-Scheme, Ashok Nagar, Jaipur 302001, India. In these Terms, \"we\" and \"us\" include Midas Signature Jewellery Private Limited, which operates the Museum.",
         "format": 0,
         "style": "",
         "mode": "normal",
         "detail": 0,
         "version": 1
